318
00:21:19,580 --> 00:21:20,280
Sis!

319
00:21:20,460 --> 00:21:21,050
Stop it.

320
00:21:22,900 --> 00:21:25,710
If you two didn't get along,

321
00:21:25,730 --> 00:21:27,760
why did her mom invite you over?

322
00:21:28,010 --> 00:21:30,200
Unless she's trying to find
her daughter a partner, right?

323
00:21:30,590 --> 00:21:31,480
Correct!

324
00:21:31,500 --> 00:21:32,500
Well an-a-lies.

325
00:21:32,520 --> 00:21:33,600
- "Analyzed!"
- "Analyzed!"

326
00:21:34,200 --> 00:21:35,310
Aha.

327
00:21:36,560 --> 00:21:39,230
Well, I think what Lada said

328
00:21:39,250 --> 00:21:41,600
makes a lot of sense.

329
00:21:43,060 --> 00:21:44,720
Then I can tell you,

330
00:21:44,750 --> 00:21:47,610
