331
00:21:49,080 --> 00:21:50,960
You don't like her?

332
00:21:51,060 --> 00:21:52,800
It's worse than that.

333
00:21:53,100 --> 00:21:54,600
If I had to date her,

334
00:21:54,750 --> 00:21:57,030
I'd rather date a dog.

335
00:21:59,420 --> 00:22:01,810
But you've already pictured...

336
00:22:02,200 --> 00:22:03,290
yourself dating her.

337
00:22:05,010 --> 00:22:07,400
So, you don't mind that
she's a woman, right?

338
00:22:08,090 --> 00:22:09,720
It's not about that.

339
00:22:09,980 --> 00:22:12,260
It’s because of who she is.

340
00:22:12,460 --> 00:22:15,200
But if her mother is rooting
for you this much,

341
00:22:15,540 --> 00:22:17,210
it can only mean that

342
00:22:17,230 --> 00:22:18,520
Miss Architect
has brought women home before.

343
00:22:19,290 --> 00:22:20,890
This means

344
00:22:20,910 --> 00:22:22,900
she might have dated women before, too.

345
00:22:22,920 --> 00:22:24,440
Sis!

346
00:22:25,810 --> 00:22:27,310
Lioness...

347
00:22:28,500 --> 00:22:29,160
Huh?

348
00:22:30,300 --> 00:22:32,560
Isn't it a "lady-killer"?

349
00:22:32,670 --> 00:22:33,590
Yeah.

350
00:22:34,800 --> 00:22:36,140
Pretty much the same.

351
00:22:36,340 --> 00:22:38,390
Whenever Miss Architect was stressed,

352
00:22:38,610 --> 00:22:41,790
she'd ruffle her hair
until it looked like a lion's mane.

353
00:22:46,180 --> 00:22:48,200
You said you don't like her,

354
00:22:48,240 --> 00:22:50,000
but you do care about her a lot.

355
00:22:50,100 --> 00:22:52,880
You even coined a word just for her.

356
00:22:52,900 --> 00:22:54,420
- Mm.
- "Lion."

357
00:22:55,290 --> 00:22:56,410
Let me tell you.

358
00:22:56,440 --> 00:22:59,480
I'm calling it now...

359
00:22:59,530 --> 00:23:00,420
"Love...

360
00:23:00,440 --> 00:23:01,000
is...

361
00:23:01,020 --> 00:23:02,970
coming!"

362
00:23:02,990 --> 00:23:03,940
No way!

363
00:23:03,960 --> 00:23:05,370
Absolutely not.

364
00:23:05,390 --> 00:23:06,020
Why?

365
00:23:06,040 --> 00:23:08,180
I'll prove you wrong.

366
00:23:09,820 --> 00:23:11,320
I've seen it all.

367
00:23:11,340 --> 00:23:12,700
Those feng shui masters
who claim to be so accurate,

368
00:23:12,720 --> 00:23:14,240
