369
00:23:14,260 --> 00:23:15,650
when it comes to themselves.

370
00:23:16,810 --> 00:23:17,900
Nan!

371
00:23:18,390 --> 00:23:19,390
I'm telling the truth.

372
00:23:19,790 --> 00:23:21,080
Just you wait.

373
00:23:27,760 --> 00:23:29,810
