enhancing your fortune...

374
00:23:32,080 --> 00:23:33,450
The architects are here.

375
00:23:34,250 --> 00:23:35,850
Please invite them in

376
00:23:35,870 --> 00:23:37,690
so we can discuss the project together.

377
00:23:45,410 --> 00:23:46,510
Feng Shui Master Xinxin.

378
00:23:46,590 --> 00:23:47,320
Yes?

379
00:23:48,240 --> 00:23:49,390
This is Soul,

380
00:23:49,410 --> 00:23:51,620
an architect from JR CONSTRUCTION.

381
00:23:52,110 --> 00:23:53,160
Miss Architect?!

382
00:23:53,180 --> 00:23:54,180
Miss Feng Shui?!

383
00:23:54,340 --> 00:23:55,480
We're f*cked...

384
00:23:56,110 --> 00:23:57,000
Uh...

385
00:23:57,100 --> 00:23:58,790
Did you two know each other?

386
00:23:59,110 --> 00:24:00,000
Well...

387
00:24:00,270 --> 00:24:01,390
perfect, then.

388
00:24:01,410 --> 00:24:03,300
My project should go smoothly,

389
00:24:03,500 --> 00:24:04,930
since you two

390
00:24:04,950 --> 00:24:06,600
should find it easy to work together.

391
00:24:07,100 --> 00:24:09,090
Maybe they won't work together at all...

392
00:24:09,790 --> 00:24:11,060
Uh, what did you say?

393
00:24:11,080 --> 00:24:12,080
Oh.

394
00:24:12,120 --> 00:24:14,120
No. I didn't say anything.

395
00:24:14,320 --> 00:24:16,070
Yes. They work together really well.

396
00:24:22,930 --> 00:24:23,880
Soul.

397
00:24:26,810 --> 00:24:27,860
Goodbye.

398
00:24:27,890 --> 00:24:29,000
See you tomorrow.

399
00:24:29,140 --> 00:24:30,010
Mm,

400
00:24:30,030 --> 00:24:31,530
drive safely.

401
00:24:34,600 --> 00:24:35,540
Soul,

402
00:24:35,560 --> 00:24:36,700
we can't fail this, alright?

403
00:24:36,720 --> 00:24:37,470
Don't forget:

404
00:24:37,490 --> 00:24:38,300
"Work is money,

405
00:24:38,320 --> 00:24:39,200
