406
00:24:44,300 --> 00:24:47,640
Are you the only architect in Thailand?

407
00:24:47,870 --> 00:24:49,650
Are you the only

408
00:24:49,670 --> 00:24:51,040
feng shui master in Thailand?

409
00:24:51,370 --> 00:24:53,300
Why does Mr. Mongkol have to hire you?

410
00:24:53,900 --> 00:24:56,760
Maybe it's because
I'm a really good feng shui master.

411
00:24:57,130 --> 00:24:57,810
You think?

412
00:24:57,830 --> 00:25:00,520
Then I must be
a really good architect, too.

413
00:25:01,700 --> 00:25:03,720
If you don't want to work with me,

414
00:25:03,890 --> 00:25:05,210
you'd better withdraw.

415
00:25:06,540 --> 00:25:08,400
Why do I have to?

416
00:25:08,680 --> 00:25:11,700
The deal was made when
we were looking for the location.

417
00:25:12,010 --> 00:25:13,700
You're the one who should withdraw.

418
00:25:15,490 --> 00:25:16,810
I can withdraw from the project,

419
00:25:17,400 --> 00:25:18,760
but why do I have to?

420
00:25:24,720 --> 00:25:26,440
So, you believe what I say now?

421
00:25:27,190 --> 00:25:27,900
What?

422
00:25:28,810 --> 00:25:30,610
The lucky color of the day.

423
00:25:31,120 --> 00:25:32,200
Well, well...

424
00:25:32,240 --> 00:25:33,600
Dressed in all green, huh?

425
00:25:33,910 --> 00:25:36,320
Guess you don't need
my inhaler anymore, right?

426
00:25:36,500 --> 00:25:38,040
It's just a coincidence.

427
00:25:38,490 --> 00:25:39,700
Wow...

428
00:25:39,800 --> 00:25:41,800
