432
00:26:22,130 --> 00:26:23,780
[Lucky color chart]

433
00:26:23,800 --> 00:26:28,790
[Friday: Green, Pink]

434
00:27:04,310 --> 00:27:05,700
Are you coming with me?

435
00:27:06,910 --> 00:27:07,910
I'm alright.

436
00:27:08,710 --> 00:27:10,540
