437
00:27:10,560 --> 00:27:13,000
By the time you get a car,
it'll be raining.

438
00:27:15,120 --> 00:27:16,520
You're awfully nice to me.

439
00:27:17,560 --> 00:27:19,910
As a fellow human being...

440
00:27:20,900 --> 00:27:21,900
I'll give you a fair price.

441
00:27:23,030 --> 00:27:25,440
Then go back by yourself.

442
00:27:25,660 --> 00:27:26,510
Gosh,

443
00:27:26,800 --> 00:27:27,800
don't be stubborn.

444
00:27:27,930 --> 00:27:28,800
Get in the car.

445
00:27:28,820 --> 00:27:30,600
I'm too tired to argue with you.

446
00:27:36,210 --> 00:27:37,010
Come on.

447
00:28:03,950 --> 00:28:05,960
Your mom called me the other day.

448
00:28:07,570 --> 00:28:08,640
Hey!

449
00:28:08,800 --> 00:28:10,500
Hey, careful! What are you doing?!

450
00:28:12,830 --> 00:28:14,890
What's with the big reaction?

451
00:28:18,710 --> 00:28:21,280
Did my mom do anything to bother you?

452
00:28:23,310 --> 00:28:25,080
She didn't do anything.

453
00:28:25,150 --> 00:28:28,020
She just called
to invite me over for dinner,

454
00:28:28,870 --> 00:28:30,610
but I already turned her down.

455
00:28:31,690 --> 00:28:34,200
Guess she's not buying that

456
00:28:34,220 --> 00:28:36,190
we aren't actually dating.

457
00:28:42,420 --> 00:28:44,310
What's the matter, Miss Architect?

458
00:28:47,300 --> 00:28:48,400
I'm...

459
00:28:48,720 --> 00:28:51,000
I'm sorry on behalf of my mom.

460
00:28:51,210 --> 00:28:52,970
I'll tell her

461
00:28:52,990 --> 00:28:54,690
not to bother you again.

462
00:28:55,600 --> 00:28:56,400
Hey,

463
00:28:56,960 --> 00:28:58,390
I didn't tell you

464
00:28:58,910 --> 00:29:01,000
so you'd go fight with your mom.

465
00:29:01,300 --> 00:29:03,120
I was just sharing it with you.

466
00:29:05,310 --> 00:29:07,720
But what my mom did was wrong, too.

467
00:29:07,980 --> 00:29:09,210
Actually, that day,

468
00:29:09,230 --> 00:29:10,980
I was going to tell you

469
00:29:11,000 --> 00:29:13,610
not to mind what my mom said

470
00:29:13,630 --> 00:29:16,510
or how she tried to set us up.

471
00:29:17,910 --> 00:29:20,410
You must have felt so uncomfortable.

472
00:29:23,710 --> 00:29:25,420
I didn't feel anything.

473
00:29:26,020 --> 00:29:27,290
You're overthinking it.

474
00:29:33,410 --> 00:29:34,410
So...

475
00:29:35,940 --> 00:29:37,680
what do you think about...

476
00:29:37,810 --> 00:29:39,600
people who like the same sex?

477
00:29:42,110 --> 00:29:43,700
Love is love.

478
00:29:46,100 --> 00:29:46,790
And...

479
00:29:47,910 --> 00:29:50,400
it doesn't bother you?

480
00:29:53,710 --> 00:29:55,600
For me...

481
00:29:56,110 --> 00:29:56,970
No, it doesn't.

482
00:29:58,100 --> 00:29:59,400
Hey,

483
00:29:59,610 --> 00:30:02,180
society has changed a lot these days.

484
00:30:02,910 --> 00:30:05,820
People are just
falling in love with someone.

485
00:30:06,600 --> 00:30:08,290
It's not a sin or anything,

486
00:30:09,200 --> 00:30:12,100
but it has to stay
within moral boundaries, too

487
00:30:13,010 --> 00:30:15,800
If it makes you happy
and doesn't hurt anyone,

488
00:30:16,300 --> 00:30:17,890
just go for it.

489
00:30:24,110 --> 00:30:24,910
Well...

490
00:30:26,110 --> 00:30:27,190
I...

491
00:30:27,610 --> 00:30:29,400
used to date women.

492
00:30:31,100 --> 00:30:32,100
So what?

493
00:30:33,210 --> 00:30:34,000
I mean...

494
00:30:34,920 --> 00:30:36,800
doesn't that shock you?

495
00:30:37,520 --> 00:30:39,090
I would be shocked

496
00:30:39,110 --> 00:30:40,800
if you were a ghost.

497
00:30:41,510 --> 00:30:43,100
But you’re still human.

498
00:30:47,900 --> 00:30:48,890
Well...

499
00:30:49,000 --> 00:30:51,200
if I'm close to any woman,

500
00:30:52,200 --> 00:30:54,010
my mom often thinks...

501
00:30:54,610 --> 00:30:56,000
she's my girlfriend.

502
00:30:59,210 --> 00:31:00,440
Are we close?

503
00:31:01,890 --> 00:31:02,480
Uh...

504
00:31:04,110 --> 00:31:06,610
I mean, if I were around a woman,

505
00:31:06,630 --> 00:31:08,690
something like that.

506
00:31:08,710 --> 00:31:09,800
Oh.

507
00:31:10,110 --> 00:31:11,320
Mm...

508
00:31:11,600 --> 00:31:13,110
Even though you didn't tell me,

509
00:31:13,400 --> 00:31:14,960
I could guess

510
00:31:15,200 --> 00:31:16,870
that you're...

511
00:31:16,890 --> 00:31:18,210
a lioness.

512
00:31:19,090 --> 00:31:19,720
Huh?

513
00:31:21,220 --> 00:31:22,800
What do you mean by that?

514
00:31:31,300 --> 00:31:32,300
Hey.

515
00:31:35,210 --> 00:31:37,000
Hey, you.

516
00:32:17,490 --> 00:32:18,960
It's alright.

517
00:32:19,390 --> 00:32:20,580
It's alright.

518
00:32:20,610 --> 00:32:21,900
It's okay, it's okay.

519
00:32:59,370 --> 00:33:00,020
Hey.

520
00:33:03,330 --> 00:33:04,210
Hey.

521
00:33:04,780 --> 00:33:05,780
We're here.

522
00:33:11,800 --> 00:33:13,000
Are you alright?

523
00:33:16,400 --> 00:33:18,290
Thanks for the ride.

524
00:33:22,010 --> 00:33:23,190
You should get inside.

525
00:33:30,710 --> 00:33:31,710
Wait.

526
00:33:31,740 --> 00:33:32,390
Huh?

527
00:33:33,910 --> 00:33:35,900
I still don't know what you mean by...

528
00:33:35,920 --> 00:33:37,560
