529
00:34:00,390 --> 00:34:01,100
Oh?

530
00:34:03,400 --> 00:34:04,110
Hey!

531
00:34:12,620 --> 00:34:15,190
I think you might wanna check your fortune.

532
00:34:15,420 --> 00:34:16,640
You might be in for some bad luck.

533
00:34:17,600 --> 00:34:18,600
What bad luck?

534
00:34:19,520 --> 00:34:20,410
Well, you see,

535
00:34:20,440 --> 00:34:21,230
it was raining,

536
00:34:21,250 --> 00:34:22,700
you couldn't get a car,

537
00:34:23,090 --> 00:34:24,400
and you also forgot your bag.

538
00:34:27,480 --> 00:34:28,000
Give me that.

539
00:34:29,640 --> 00:34:30,640
What's the magic word?

540
00:34:36,410 --> 00:34:37,720
Thank you.

541
00:34:38,710 --> 00:34:39,960
Say it again,

542
00:34:40,210 --> 00:34:41,590
like you mean it.

543
00:34:45,190 --> 00:34:45,830
Thank.

544
00:34:45,860 --> 00:34:46,710
You.

545
00:34:46,730 --> 00:34:47,480
Very much!

546
00:34:50,310 --> 00:34:51,080
Hey!

547
00:34:52,600 --> 00:34:53,280
Oh?

548
00:34:55,110 --> 00:34:58,700
Besides wearing the lucky color outside,

549
00:34:58,920 --> 00:35:01,090
do you wear it inside too, Miss Architect?

550
00:35:01,290 --> 00:35:01,840
Hey.

551
00:35:01,910 --> 00:35:02,940
Well, well...

552
00:35:02,970 --> 00:35:05,720
Who said it was just nonsense?

553
00:35:06,010 --> 00:35:07,680
What are you talking about? Nonsense.

554
00:35:08,080 --> 00:35:09,190
But...

555
00:35:09,900 --> 00:35:11,360
I think I saw it.

556
00:35:11,700 --> 00:35:12,910
So...

557
00:35:13,100 --> 00:35:14,520
